  {
    "id": 3015002010230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふ……いい笑顔\r\nそのゲーム、すごく好きなんだ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500201/3015002010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015002010240,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……前に出たゲームの続きで……\r\nそのとき、いっぱい遊んだ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500201/3015002010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015002010250,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "このゲームでは……主人公が歌の力で世界を救う……\r\nすっごくかっこよくて、きらきら……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500201/3015002010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015002010260,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "楽しそう～\r\n私もやってみたいな",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500201/3015002010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015002010270,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……あ、あの……\r\nこれ、協力プレイも、できるから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500201/3015002010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015002010280,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "こ、今度、事務所で一緒に……\r\nや、やる……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500201/3015002010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015002010290,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "わぁ、ありがとう♪\r\nあ、そのゲームって３人でも遊べるのかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500201/3015002010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015002010300,
